<title>MALAWI: SOCCER-MALAWI WINS AFRICA NATIONS CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-MALAWI WINS AFRICA NATIONS CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>BLANTYRE 1997-02-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of Africa Nations Cup qualifying match group 7 on Saturday:</p>
<p>    Malawi    2	Mozambique   0  (halftime 1-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: John Maduka 6th, Roland Kamanga 60th.</p>
<p>Stadium capacity: 30,000.</p>
